  <div class="logo">Logo</div>
  <div class="links">
    <a href="#">Home</a>
    <a href="#">About</a>
    <a href="#">Contact</a>
  </div>
</div>
```

If you want to keep the `float: right` approach, you'd need to add `clear: both` to the container to handle the floating elements properly. But I'd strongly recommend `flexbox` for this layout — it's much cleaner and avoids the float issues entirely.

