To center a `div` horizontally, use `display: flex` on the parent container and set `justify-content: center`:

```css
.parent {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}
```

You can also use `margin: auto` on the child if you know its width:

```css
.child {
  margin: auto;
}
```

